bob saget's cause of death has been  revealed  in a statement released to e.t on  wednesday the saggett family shared  details they've learned from the  investigation  saga died on january 9th the late  comedian was found unresponsive in his  hotel room following a stand-up  performance in florida he was 65. the  statement explains quote the authorities  have determined that bob passed from  head trauma they have concluded that he  accidentally hit the back of his head on  something thought nothing of it and went  to sleep no drugs or alcohol were  involved the family also expressed  gratitude for the outpouring of support  following saggett's death they wrote in  the statement quote in the weeks since  bob's passing we have been overwhelmed  with the incredible outpouring of love  from bob's fans which has been a great  comfort to us and for which we are  eternally grateful he is nice and i will  say never a dull moment he's just the  most pure heart ever the family ended  their statement with a tribute it reads  quote we ask everyone to remember the  love and laughter that bob brought to  this world and the lessons he taught us  all to be kind to everyone to let the  people you love know you love them and  to face difficult times with hugs and  laughter  it's been almost a month  where are you at how are you right now  um i'm still very much grieving et  recently sat down with two members of  saggett's full house family candace  cameron beret and jody sweetin  the actresses opened up about the loss  of their on-screen dad  look look at his camera look  at his camera look she's my tv daughter  he was the real deal i can't stress that  enough but you know someone's the real  deal when you have that many people  speaking about you and have so much love  for you he would help he would drop  anything to help anyone and um  and and they didn't have to be  they were not celebrity people not  high-powered people it was just like  your mom's grandma's aunt needs help  okay